plaintext
* SPICE netlist for NPN BJT amplifier circuit

V1 2 3 DC 0
VBB 3 0 DC <VBB_value>
VCC 4 0 DC <VCC_value>

RB 2 6 <RB_value>
RC 4 Vo <RC_value>

Q1 4 6 5 NPN

* Note: Replace <VBB_value>, <VCC_value>, <RB_value>, <RC_value> with actual values
* Nodes: 
* 2 = Positive terminal of Vs
* 3 = Ground terminal for Vs
* 4 = Collector of Q1, Output Vo
* 5 = Emitter of Q1
* 6 = Base of Q1

.end